title: "Ambient AI Scribes Meta-Analysis: Documentation Time, After-Hours Work, Clinician Burnout, Note Quality, Note Errors and Hallucinations. A Cochrane-Level Systematic Review Built by an LLM Team"
version: "0.2-stage2"
