abstract: "Cochrane-level systematic review and meta-analysis of ambient AI scribes for clinical documentation, asking whether they cut documentation time and after-hours work, ease clinician burnout, and what note errors and hallucinations they add. Status at this version: Stage 2 search and screening complete, no pooled result yet. A DOI will be added when the preprint record exists."
